title: DataOps Pipeline — 8 Stages

flowchart LR
    INGEST[1️⃣ Ingestion<br/>HackerNews / arXiv / PubMed] --> VALIDATE[2️⃣ Validation<br/>schemas.py Pydantic]
    VALIDATE --> TRANSFORM[3️⃣ Transformation<br/>Entity Extraction / SQI / Bloom]
    TRANSFORM --> STORE[4️⃣ Catalog<br/>registry.json]
    STORE --> VIZ[5️⃣ Visualization<br/>core/visuals.py SVGs]
    VIZ --> RENDER[6️⃣ Rendering<br/>generator.py + J2 Templates]
    RENDER --> SERVE[7️⃣ Serving<br/>Cloudflare Pages CDN]
    SERVE --> OBSERVE[8️⃣ Observability<br/>Build Metrics / Quality Flags]

